      ],
      "en": "But he rebelled against him in sending his ambassadors into Egypt, that they might give him horses and many people. Will he prosper? Will he who does such things escape? Will he break the covenant, and still escape?",
      "ko": "그가 사자를 애굽에 보내어 말과 군대를 구함으로 바벨론 왕을 배반하였으니 형통하겠느냐 이런 일을 행한 자가 피하겠느냐 언약을 배반하고야 피하겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "9ba213a2d11ea5ea3662b05aeb1af4649c7c8699c79ae4bc983204477db061dd",
      "translation_text_hash": "58675a47b8fdac6ca4c3dcd526f6bd67be667f84534eb51002e3bd14790f6f54",
