      "en": "For he has despised the oath by breaking the covenant; and behold, he had given his hand, and yet has done all these things. He won’t escape.",
      "ko": "그가 이미 손을 내어 밀어 언약하였거늘 맹세를 업신여겨 언약을 배반하고 이 모든 일을 행하였으니 피하지 못하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "8f96bb97ce415e132c5f9340c7d9e77a933d809c2260b1c31bfeeb076ec6268f",
      "translation_text_hash": "c42bb33f08873d1de4e95af4abe3bdb4b561675744ee17f32347e0c42644c1da",
