      "en": "I will spread my net on him, and he will be taken in my snare. I will bring him to Babylon, and will enter into judgment with him there for his trespass that he has trespassed against me.",
      "ko": "내 그물을 그 위에 베풀며 내 올무에 걸리게 하여 끌고 바벨론으로 가서 나를 반역한 그 반역을 거기서 국문할찌며",
      "source_text_hash": "46cfff0b11f0882c9b63b76114844b68e4b49ec56eb7375766d19a1e00fda790",
      "translation_text_hash": "2e064c56b7ee85b95db7f10ed0f77c14f821c3b64bc82500951a3eed90da449c",
